    <title>
      <narrative xml:lang="en">International Counterproliferation Program (ICP): Chemical, Biological, Radiological, Explosives (CBRE) Workshop</narrative>
    </title>
    <description type="1">
      <narrative xml:lang="en">The CBRE workshop delivered to 37 participants from Singapore and Brunei. The participants included mid-level law enforcement officials and scientists from several units within the Singapore Police Force, as well as participants from the Singapore Ministry of Defense, and Ministry of Home Affairs. The workshop met its goal of Increasing capacity of Singapore and Brunei to effectively detect and interdict WMD materials, investigate, and properly conduct operations involving a WMD incident.</narrative>
